{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1063363/block/singleImage/3264979/df/01KR2YJMWBFAA9NNJJ90QSASAD.jpeg?updatedAt=1794450227\"/><figcaption>香港警方</figcaption></figure><p>石蔭大圓街發生連環爆竊案。 今日（12日）凌晨約3時，有人企圖撬開石蔭大圓街12至22號一個單位的後門，有街坊發現後報警。警方接報後到場調查，發現共有兩個單位有被撬過的痕跡，其中一單位更被撬開。警方在該個被撬開的單位內，當場以涉嫌「企圖爆竊」及「爆竊」拘捕一名62歲姓葉男子，並在其身上起回一批金飾，他現正被扣留調查。涉案金飾的價值有待警方聯絡戶主點算確定，案件交由葵青警區刑事調查隊第4隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.114797+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:23:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T00:32:37.626702+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:37:16.450844+00:00","content_hash":"2d898593034df33dd30a282d48a0ade0372e5f74a3cfc0bba7e2fe8c0e0b518c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:43:55.114797+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}